tion."}]}],"name":"offset"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tempo, expressed in quarter notes per minute. A value of "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" indicates the sound-generating program should prompt the user when compiling a sound file."}]}],"name":"tempo"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dynamics (or MIDI velocity), expressed as a percentage of the default forte value (90 for MIDI 1.0)."}]}],"name":"dynamics"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether to go back to the beginning of the movement."}]}],"name":"isDaCapo"},{"name":"segno","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Names a segno sign for a backward jump, used to distinguish between multiple jumps."}]}]},{"name":"dalsegno","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Names the segno sign to jump back to, used to distinguish between multiple jumps."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Names a coda sign for a forward jump, used to distinguish between multiple jumps."}]}],"name":"coda"},{"name":"tocoda","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Names the coda sign to jump forward to, used to distinguish between multiple jumps."}]}]},{"name":"divisions","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of divisions per quarter note, used together with the segno or coda attributes."}]}]},{"name":"impliesForwardRepeat","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether a forward repeat sign is implied but not displayed."}]}]},{"name":"fine","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Follows the final note or rest in a movement with a da capo or dal segno direction. If numeric, represents the actu